  21:     - Each object is a 2x3 T, either with its stem above the horizontal bar or below it.
  22: 
  23:     Rule
  24:     - Make a 3x6 black output split into two 3x3 panels.
  25:     - For each upward T, fill the next corner slot in the left panel with green.
  26:     - For each downward T, fill the next corner slot in the right panel with blue.
  27:     - The slot order inside each panel is top-left, bottom-left, top-right, bottom-right.
  28: 
  29:     Key insight
  30:     - The red objects' positions are irrelevant; only the count of each T orientation is summarized.
  31:     """
